      "en": "When Ahab heard those words, he tore his clothes, put sackcloth on his body, fasted, lay in sackcloth, and went about despondently.",
      "ko": "아합이 이 모든 말씀을 들을 때에 그 옷을 찢고 굵은 베로 몸을 동이고 금식하고 굵은 베에 누우며 행보도 천천히 한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "65ef97fc7515b8b4facd48a6a42fba275c03368a7d8b3f5dd713eb1cc6605631",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1c017c9c22b7ace47cfb6d521b69ce01a960319da74acb534255696e3e6b71f",
